---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="오시는 길 · 한국가톨릭문화원">
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="text-wine text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-3">CONTACT</div>
    <h1 class="serif text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-12">오시는 길 · 문의</h1>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">주소</div>
        <p class="serif text-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          경기도 김포시 하성면<br />
          월하로 970-18<br />
          한국가톨릭문화원 아트센터
        </p>

        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">대표번호</div>
        <p class="serif text-2xl mb-8">1577-3217</p>

        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">이메일</div>
        <p class="serif text-xl mb-8">info@koccc.kr</p>

        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">공식 채널</div>
        <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2DFlrmRnNpsMAtaicFeibg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wine underline">유튜브 · 가톨릭문화원 Alma Art</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="aspect-square bg-gradient-to-br from-sage/30 to-sage/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-ink/10 rounded" id="kakao-map">
        <div class="text-center text-ink/40">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">📍</div>
          <div class="text-sm">경기도 김포시 하성면 월하로 970-18</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-ink/30 mt-2">(배포 시 지도 표시)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-ink/50">
      <p>사단법인 한국가톨릭문화원 아트센터</p>
    </div>
  </section>

